		<p><uicontrol>AI Assistant</uicontrol> can be operated using voice recognition.</p>
		<p>Press the <uicontrol>AI Assistant</uicontrol> button or say “Hey, Kia.”</p>
		<section id="e01928">
			<title>Example (Vehicle control)</title>
			<ul id="e01929">
				<li>
					<p>“Turn on the air conditioner.”</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>“Turn off the air conditioner.”</p>
				</li>
			</ul>
		</section>
		<section id="e01930">
			<title>Example (Question)</title>
			<ul id="e01931">
				<li>
					<p>“Can you explain why the ocean is blue in a way that a 7-year-old can understand?”</p>
				</li>
			</ul>
			<note type="note" id="e01932">
				<p><uicontrol>AI Assistant</uicontrol> may provide inaccurate answers. Please check important details separately.</p>
			</note>
		</section>
	</conbody>
